[Graphics:Gunfight Sequence]
Four custom-<code>CHARS</code> <code>PRINT</code> layers (lines 5019-5120),
then cowboy frames at 5200/5250 and the hit overlay at 5300-5305.

#HTML(
<table>
  <tr>
    <th>Ready (5120)</th>
    <th>Drawing... (5200)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><img src="../#IF({vars[pub]}>2)(../)images/gunfight.png" alt="Gunfight ready"/></td>
    <td><img src="../#IF({vars[pub]}>2)(../)images/gunfight-draw1.png" alt="Gunfight drawing"/></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <th>Shooting (5250)</th>
    <th>Hit — AAAGGH! (5300-5305)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><img src="../#IF({vars[pub]}>2)(../)images/gunfight-draw2.png" alt="Gunfight shooting"/></td>
    <td><img src="../#IF({vars[pub]}>2)(../)images/gunfight-aaaggh.png" alt="Gunfight AAAGGH"/></td>
  </tr>
</table>
)

