[Graphics:Wanted Posters]
Lines 7000-7140. The face is shared; <code>D$(L)</code> selects extras
(patch, scar, moustache, missing ear, &amp;c. — DATA at 9001-9012).

#HTML(
<table>
  <tr>
    <th>Harry Longbough (L=2, limp)</th>
    <th>Harvey Logan (L=3, eyepatch)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><img src="../#IF({vars[pub]}>2)(../)images/wanted-poster.png" alt="Wanted poster Longbough"/></td>
    <td><img src="../#IF({vars[pub]}>2)(../)images/wanted-poster-eyepatch.png" alt="Wanted poster Logan eyepatch"/></td>
  </tr>
</table>
)

[Graphics:Wanted-Poster Face Overlays]
Base face (lines 7010-7065) plus <code>D$(L)</code> extras from DATA
9001-9012. Limps (left/right) only change the DESCRIPTION text — the face
is unchanged.

